&lt;h4&gt;Commitment to Equal Opportunity&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flexport, our ability to fulfill our mission of making global commerce easy and accessible relies on having a diverse, dedicated and engaged workforce. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment regardless of race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, physical and mental disability, health status, marital and family status, sexual orientation, gender identity and expression, military and veteran status, and any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Global Data Privacy Notice for Job Candidates and Applicants&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your location, the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) may regulate the way we manage the data of job applicants.&amp;nbsp;By submitting your application, you are agreeing to our use and processing of your data as required. Please see our Privacy Notice available at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.flexport.com/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.flexport.com/privacy&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1613840050053000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNHD63svlkD-hWHlGuGOM_bSYVrnpw&quot;&gt;www.flexport.com/privacy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for additional information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious Minds. Bold Ideas. Extraordinary Impact&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re transforming financial services through bold innovation and relentless execution. You bring the ideas and drive. We&#39;ll build what&#39;s next — together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Project Manager, you will be part of a high-performing professional services team focused on evaluating how the nCino product can best meet our European clients’ needs and working with the Implementation Consultant to oversee the application of a seven-step implementation process with nCino bank and credit union customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute strategic vision and adoption of nCino across financial institutions by engaging stakeholders at all levels. Foster strong relationships and ensure alignment with organizational goals for project success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full ownership of the project/program timeline, proactively addressing risks and dependencies. Implement strategies to keep deliverables on track and ensure timely completion of milestones.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads cross-functional teams using Agile methodologies, ensuring efficient delivery of projects by facilitating sprint planning, daily stand-ups, retrospectives, and ensuring continuous improvement throughout the development lifecycle.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversees large-scale implementations by managing multiple workstreams, ensuring alignment across teams, mitigating risks, and maintaining project timelines to deliver successful, integrated solutions on time and within budget&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages stakeholder relationships by ensuring clear communication, expectations alignment, and regular updates; oversees resource allocation to optimize team performance and capacity; tracks budget and burn rates to ensure projects stay within financial constraints; and monitors key performance indicators (KPIs) and business value metrics (BVMs) to assess progress, drive decision-making, and ensure delivery of high-impact outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently handle project escalations, maintaining momentum and customer satisfaction. Swiftly address challenges and implement effective problem-solving strategies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exhibit advanced skills in managing nCino project plans and tooling, including task management, resource coordination, and milestone achievement. Ensure alignment with strategic objectives and timely, budget-compliant deliverables.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide comprehensive project status updates and risk assessments to peers and senior management. Ensure transparent communication across all stakeholders, enhancing project visibility and confidence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek knowledge, refine domain skills, and work collaboratively for team success. Foster a culture of continuous learning and professional growth, developing advanced technical skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor new employees, interact with leaders across departments, and be sought out for opinions on significant matters. Lead by example, driving organizational excellence and contributing to the refinement of internal processes and tools within our teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and capitalize on whitespace within programs to drive revenue for nCino. This includes assessing additional resourcing needs, exploring cross-sell/up-sell opportunities, and negotiating higher rates based on the value provided by current resources.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools and techniques to enhance work efficiency and optimize business operations by automating routine tasks to improve accuracy, save time, and minimize errors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize AI-driven insights to refine decision-making, elevate customer experience, and boost team productivity while ensuring its application provides measurable value, driving innovation and smarter ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay informed on AI advancements to drive continuous learning and scalable growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undergraduate degree in a relevant field (e.g., Business, Management, Information Technology) or equivalent experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional experience in project management or a related field.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office Suite (Word, Excel, PowerPoint).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage complex tasks with precision, leveraging strong organizational, time management, and problem-solving skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates effectively across all levels, translating complex information into clear, audience-appropriate messaging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successfully leads projects with minimal oversight, demonstrating initiative while appropriately escalating issues when needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds credibility and influence through transparent communication, collaborative engagement, and consistent follow-through.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively supports organizational change by identifying opportunities for improvement and constructively challenging existing processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Desired:&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;nCino experience (as an end user or nCino implementation) &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP/PMI certification preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position may require travel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous project management experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in multiple lines of business in banking&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with agile software delivery practices and concepts&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The pay range for this role is based on relative market data and alignment with our compensation philosophy. The range displayed reflects the minimum and maximum of the pay range for each job posting, which is used to determine new hire rates/salaries and takes into consideration multiple factors including but not limited to knowledge, skills, abilities, proficiencies, experience, education, &lt;span class=&quot;WGI1&quot;&gt;licensures/certifications,&lt;/span&gt; as well as business and organizational needs. nCino reserves the right to modify the posted range consistent with our internal practices and external market movement. The recruiter for this job posting can share more compensation details during the recruitment process, as base salary is only one component of the total compensation package per position posted.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this job is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£63,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£107,400 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;nCino provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, age, protected veteran status, disability, genetics or other protected groups. In addition to federal law requirements, nCino complies with applicable state and local laws governing nondiscrimination in employment in every location in which the company has facilities. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;nCino is committed to the full inclusion of all qualified individuals. As part of this commitment, nCino will ensure that persons with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations. If reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and/or to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, please contact us at &lt;a ----- -----
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to inclusion and equality includes a strong belief that the diversity of our team is instrumental to our success.&amp;nbsp; We strive to create workplaces where employees are empowered to bring their authentic selves to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.ncino.com/ncino-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;Please view our Applicant Privacy Policy here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our leading SaaS-based Global Employment Platform™ enables clients to expand into over 180 countries quickly and efficiently, without the complexities of establishing local entities. At G-P, we’re dedicated to breaking down barriers to global business and creating opportunities for everyone, everywhere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our diverse, remote-first teams are essential to our success. We empower our Dream Team members with flexibility and resources, fostering an environment where innovation thrives and every contribution is valued and celebrated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The work you do here will positively impact lives around the world. We stand by our promise: Opportunity Made Possible. In addition to competitive compensation and benefits, we invite you to join us in expanding your skills and helping to reshape the future of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At G-P, we assist organizations in building exceptional global teams in days, not months—streamlining the hiring, onboarding, and management process to unlock growth potential for all.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Field Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt;, you will join a high-performing team laser-focused on taking over the market, building a world-class company, and solving the complex international expansion needs of thousands of employers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this full-cycle outbound role, you will lead the charge in driving new logo acquisition across the EMEA region. We are looking for relentless hunters who excel at multi-threaded deal execution, master modern prospecting frameworks, and leverage cutting-edge AI tools to maximize their impact. If you thrive in a fast-paced environment and have a deep desire to win, this is your opportunity to build a high-growth sales career at the recognized leader in Employer of Record (EoR).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Targeted Outbound Prospecting:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute a sophisticated multi-channel prospecting motion (phone, email, social selling, video, etc.) to build a robust, high-quality pipeline across target EMEA accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-Threaded Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Build strategic relationships across prospect organizations—from key operational champions up to economic buyers and C-level executives—aligning our solutions with their top-level business initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver the G-P Value Proposition:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a domain expert on global hiring, articulating the strategic, financial, and operational benefits of G-P as the premier global Employer of Record (EoR) provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Cycle Deal Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead complex sales cycles from initial cold outreach to discovery, solution mapping, commercial proposal generation, objection handling, and deal closure against monthly targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigorously Manage Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain meticulous pipeline hygiene across all prospect stages, ensuring accurate forecasting and high-quality data management within Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with internal teams—including Sales Engineering, Legal, Marketing, Operations and Customer Success—to align resources, navigate complex deal requirements, and drive revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage AI for Maximum Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Intentionally integrate modern generative AI and sales tech tools into your daily workflow to research accounts, personalize outreach, automate workflows, and increase sales velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Minimum Requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree in Business, Finance, International Relations, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of sales experience, with 3+ years of proven success in a full-cycle, outbound-focused B2B sales role with a track record of consistently meeting or exceeding revenue quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outbound Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ownership of an end-to-end multi-channel prospecting motion, with advanced skills in cold outreach and C-suite engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Methodologies:&lt;/strong&gt; High competency and structured application of modern sales methodologies (e.g., Command of the Message, MEDDPICC, Challenger, Sandler, SPIN).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack &amp;amp; AI Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong proficiency with Salesforce and LinkedIn Sales Navigator. Hands-on experience leveraging modern Generative AI tools to enhance prospecting efficiency and workflow productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of B2B SaaS sales cycles, commercial negotiation, and complex buyer dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Impact Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional written, verbal, and presentation skills, with the ability to command attention, articulate complex value, and build immediate trust over video and phone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Mindset &amp;amp; Drive:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong desire to win, high coachability, a relentless growth mindset, and an authentic curiosity for solving complex customer problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience selling within the HR Tech, Employer of Record (EoR), global payroll, or workforce management ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Intelligence Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with modern revenue intelligence and tech stack tools (e.g., Gong, Clari, Cognism, Outreach).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;message-list_1761669766.039629&quot; class=&quot;c-virtual_list__item&quot; data-qa=&quot;virtual-list-item&quot; data-item-key=&quot;1761669766.039629&quot;&gt;
