&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of meeting or exceeding sales targets, ideally in enterprise software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence in challenging and building consensus with executive decision makers, including the C-suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex sales cycles with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with European banking regulation and governance (banking or commercial banking knowledge is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong listening skills and clear written and verbal communication, with the ability to demonstrate software on site or virtually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative approach to working with product, services, support and finance colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
